  "$comment": [
    "The machine-readable twin map. Prose, rationale and the do-not-cross rules",
    "live in docs/specs/2026-08-22-web-ios-parity-contract.md; this file is only",
    "the pairing, so scripts/parity-check.ts can read it without a parser.",
    "",
    "A module with no twin is not a defect — it may be genuinely web-only. It is",
    "a defect when a twin exists and only one side moved."
