  "$tokens": "Roles both design systems declare, compared against the palette pack (packages/tokens/src/palette), which apps/web's theme is built from and which already carries the sRGB hex of every Bloom oklch value, so nothing here has to re-derive OKLCH. `assert` roles must agree exactly; a role either side cannot read is an error, not a skip. `derived` roles are reported for information only: apps/ios/design.md says the paper ramp is DERIVED from the same OKLCH source, not copied, and Palette.ground / Palette.caution are deliberate native choices.",
  "tokens": {
    "pack": "packages/tokens/src/palette",
    "swift": "apps/ios/Pattadar/Sources/DesignSystem.swift",
    "assert": [
